{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 RNA encoder, replacing the PCA encoder from the baseline (config_001). Validation accuracy of 0.520 (vs. 0.485 in config_001) and F1 of 0.498 suggest improved performance, indicating the scvi_n200 encoder may offer better representation. However, the impact of aggregation methods or fusion strategies remains uncertain, as these factors were not evaluated in this isolated comparison."
}

